        "r": 253.497,
        "b": 763.5783344167462
      },
      "content": "When selected the oven heats up to 275 o C."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0693",
      "reading_order": 886,
      "section": "Temperature control test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.0,
        "t": 636.9060195312501,
        "r": 323.55899999999997,
        "b": 628.8183344167462
      },
      "content": "The preheat status can be viewed by selecting temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0694",
      "reading_order": 887,
      "section": "Temperature control test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 54.003,
        "t": 482.00257953125003,
        "r": 554.6850000000003,
        "b": 460.0983344167462
      },
      "content": "Once the oven reaches temperature, select the green tick to start. The oven will run on heat only, convection fan at 100%, for 30 minutes cycling around the maximum cavity temperature of 275 o C."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0695",
      "reading_order": 888,
      "section": "Temperature control test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.99999999999994,
        "t": 455.82901953125,
        "r": 271.2599999999999,
        "b": 447.7413344167462
      },
      "content": "Independently monitor the cavity temperature."
    },
    {
      "type": "list_item",
      "id": "txt_0696",
      "reading_order": 889,
      "section": "Temperature control test",
      "bbox": {
        "l": 53.999999999999915,
        "t": 443.83201953125,
        "r": 366.17399999999986,
        "b": 435.7443344167462
      },
      "content": "On completion of the test, specify the result by selecting 'Pass' or 'Fail'."
